# Pre-deploy type safety

Vercel runs `next build`, which typechecks. Local `npm run build` is slow; prefer:

```bash
npm run type-check
```

Before ending a task that touches `src/**/*.ts` or `src/**/*.tsx` (especially `src/lib/**` or admin APIs):

1. Run `npm run type-check`
2. Fix any errors you introduced
3. Only then commit/push

Do not leave known `tsc` errors for Vercel to catch.
